        "eng": "While crowded in daytime, this London neighbourhood has been haunted by a vampire killer for many nights. The protagonist wakes up in a residence, with a man calling himself \"Holmes\" claiming to have entered the house in pursuit of a vampire. Unknowingly, the residence's door has been locked from the outside...",
